      "id": "sections-and-notes",
      "title": "Sections and notes",
      "html": "<h3>Layout</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Flat list:</strong> notes sit one under another. Good for class notes, a journal or quick ideas.</li><li><strong>Grouped:</strong> you see groups first, then the notes inside a group. Good for books, projects and larger subjects.</li><li>Drag sections in the sidebar to reorder them.</li><li><strong>List</strong> shows rows; <strong>Card</strong> shows a more visual grid.</li></ul>\n<h3>Quick actions</h3>\n<p>Right-click a section, group or note (long-press on mobile) for rename, share, hide, move and delete.</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Hide</strong> does not delete a section. Bring it back from <strong>⋯ → Hidden sections</strong>.</li><li>Everything you delete goes to <strong>Trash</strong> and waits there for <strong>30 days</strong>.</li><li>Use <strong>Undo</strong> in the delete notification to bring it back immediately.</li></ul>\n<h3>Bulk actions</h3>\n<p>Choose <strong>Select</strong> from a section or group menu, then tap notes to select them. The bottom bar can <strong>move</strong>, <strong>export</strong> or <strong>delete</strong> the selection. Use <code>Shift</code> for a range and <code>Ctrl + A</code> for everything.</p>"
